Third-party data:

  - The Field Notes dose reference (dose ranges, durations, graded interactions)
    is based on a snapshot of DoseWiki (https://dose.wiki), with substantial
    revisions: structural errors are corrected on load and some substances'
    figures are replaced from Erowid and published sources (see
    data/dosewiki/REVISIONS.txt and ROUTE_OVERRIDES in src-tauri/core/src/pw.rs).
    The reference prose is DoseWiki's as written. DoseWiki dedicates its encyclopedia to
    the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal dedication (the
    DoseWiki site code is MIT-licensed). No attribution is legally required; a
    courtesy credit to DoseWiki is shown in-app wherever this data is displayed.
    The snapshot is bundled with the app and used fully offline — no network
    request is made when the user looks anything up. See data/dosewiki/README.md
    for the snapshot source and processing pipeline.

